18589	Q0	exploredata-ZA4584_Varv432	22	26.119661	instruments_tools	On these cards there are various aspects of the world of work and careers. How important to you personally are these job characteristics For your answers please use the scale from 1 to 7.On these cards there are various aspects of the world of work and careers. How important to you personally are these job characteristics On the right hand side of each of these cards is a scale with 7 categories. The category at the bottom with the number 1 means this sphere of life is unimportant to you.Category number 7 at the very top means this sphere of life is very important to you.You can use the numbers in between to differentiate your answers.I will now present you with various aspects of the world of work and careers. How important to you personally are these job characteristics On this card there is a scale with 7 categories.The category at the bottom with the number 1 means this sphere of life is unimportant to you. Category number 7 at the very top means this sphere of life is very important to you.You can use the numbers in between to differentiate your answers.
