2500	Q0	exploredata-ZA2831_Varv402	92	10.717862	instruments_tools	Tous les cinq ans les Francais elisent les membres francais du Parlement europeen sur des listes nationales c est a dire que les noms des candidates sont les memes dans toute la France. Certains estiments que ce mode d election est le mieux adapte pour representer la France au Parlement europeen. D autres pensent qu il faudrait avoir des listes regionales pour rapprocher les deputes europeens des citoyens. Vous personellement comment pensez vous que l on devrait elire les deputes europeens Every five years the French vote for the French members of the European Parliament through national lists that means that the names of the candidates are the same all over France. Some people say that this election mode would be the most adequate for representing France in the European Parliament. Others think that it would be better to have regional lists for bringing the European representatives closer to the citizens. In your personal opinion how should the European representatives be elected
