3307	Q0	exploredata-ZA5961_VarCASEID	75	17.262873	instruments_tools	ISSP 1995 ZA2880 v2 ISSP 2003 ZA3910 V3 ISSP 2013 ZA5950 CASEID caseid Respondent Identification Number.The Respondent Identification Numbers are taken from the integrated data files unmodified . This uniquely identifies each respondent.in ZA5950 2013 CASEID ID Number of RespondentThis variable contains the original identification numbers of the respondents. This variable attaches a unique identification number to each respondent with year of the module country subsample V3 and ID number CASEID .in ZA3910 2003 V3 Respondent NumberThis number uniquely identifies each respondent. It is composed of two sections containing eight numbers in total. The first two digits are identical with the country codes 01 43 of variable COUNTRY . The digits following behind contain the original identification number.in ZA2880 1995 v2 Respondent ID NumberThis uniquely identifies each respondent. The first two digits are identical with the country code the next five digits contain the original identification number.
